#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ikwsopts_ui.ui line 197
#: ikwsopts.cpp:86 rc.cpp:54
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nome"

#: ikwsopts.cpp:95
msgid ""
"<p>In this module you can configure the web shortcuts feature. Web shortcuts "
"allow you to quickly search or lookup words on the Internet. For example, to "
"search for information about the KDE project using the Google engine, you "
"simply type <b>gg:KDE</b> or <b>google:KDE</b>.</p><p>If you select a "
"default search engine, normal words or phrases will be looked up at the "
"specified search engine by simply typing them into applications, such as "
"Konqueror, that have built-in support for such a feature.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Neste módulo poderá configurar os atallos web. Estes atallos permítenlle "
"procurar rapidamente palabras en Internet. Por exemplo, para procurar "
"información acerca do proxecto KDE mediante Google, simplesmente escreba "
"<b>gg:KDE</b> ou <b>google:KDE</b>.</p><p>Se escolle un motor por omisión, "
"as palabras ou frases normais serán procuradas nese motor simplesmente "
"escrebéndoas en programas, como Konqueror, que teñan soporte incorporado "
"para esta funcionalidade.</p>"

#: kurisearchfilter.cpp:91
msgid "Search F&ilters"
msgstr "&Filtros de procura"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ikwsopts_ui.ui line 30
#: rc.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"Enable shortcuts that allow you to quickly search for information on the "
"web. For example, entering the shortcut <b>gg:KDE</b> will result in a "
"search for the word <b>KDE</b> on the Google(TM) search engine.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"Habilite atallos que lle permitan procurar axilmente información na web. Por "
"exemplo, co atallo <b>gg:KDE</b> procurará a palabra <b>KDE</b> co motor de "
"procuras Google(TM).</qt>"

#. i18n: tag string
